Leapmotor application TLS certificate

What: the client certificate and key of the Leapmotor Android app — the pair inside every copy
of the app, identical for every user. It is not an account certificate: it opens the login only.
The account certificate the cloud then issues for each device stays in that installation's own
volume and is never shipped.

Source: recovered from the official Leapmotor app V1.16.4-1 at runtime, 26/09/2026.
