Mate installs this pair into a new installation at startup (automatic_material.provision_automatic),
so nobody is asked for it; an installation that already holds a pair keeps its own. When Leapmotor
replaces the certificate, a Mate release replaces both files and the hashes pinned in
automatic_material.CERTIFICATE_SHA256 — tests/test_automatic_material.py turns red in CI six months
before the packaged pair expires.
